      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roachdale%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Roachdale hosts a Carnegie Library, a historic building that reflects the town’s early investment in public education.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
